Though the annals of history are unclear, a Seeker who became ruler of Easter Island may have used this Titan to defend against the island's enemies. The maoi statues on the island may have, in turn, been built to honor Sentinel. {{source|Huntik.com}}

Sentinel was summoned by [[LeBlanche]] to defend the huntik team at a fast food restaurant when few [[Suits]] attacked them. It then defended [[Lok]]'s [[Freelancer]]l and fought [[Enforcer]]. {{Source|All Work and No Pay}}

LeBlanche invoked Sentinel to protect [[Sophie]] from a trap in the [[Crystal Caves]] where it worked beside [[Albion]] to stop the trap from reaching Sophie. After she reached the trapped throne, both Titans were called back to their [[Amulets]] by LeBlanche. {{Source|Cave of the Casterwills}}

Sentinel was again used by LeBlanche to defend the [[Casterwills]] during the battle of the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. After fending off numerous attacks from [[Silent Soldiers]], it was defeated by [[Marduk]] and his [[Cerberus]]. {{Source|The Spiral War}}
